<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head runat="server"><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Diagnostics - Babco SQL AI Agent</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="SqlAgent0106.css?v=20260901.1"/></head><body><form runat="server"><div class="prototypeRibbon">PROTOTYPE</div><header class="finalHeader"><div class="finalBrand"><div class="brandMark">B</div><div><span class="eyebrow">BABCO LABS · SQL AI AGENT</span><h1>Monitoring & Diagnostics</h1><p>Live application health and runtime checks</p></div></div><div class="finalHeaderState"><span class="statePill"><i></i> Runtime monitor</span><a class="headerBtn" href="Default.aspx">Back to Agent</a></div></header><nav class="finalNav"><a class="finalNavItem" href="Default.aspx"><span>✦</span> Today</a><a class="finalNavItem" href="Default.aspx#agent"><span>⌁</span> SQL Agent</a><% if(SQL_AI_Agent.AuthService.IsAdmin){ %><a class="finalNavItem" href="Admin.aspx"><span>◫</span> Cost</a><% } %><a class="finalNavItem" href="Help.aspx"><span>?</span> Help</a><a class="finalNavItem" href="Standard.aspx"><span>▣</span> Standard</a><a class="finalNavItem active" href="Diagnostics.aspx"><span>⚙</span> Diagnostics</a></nav><main class="page"><section class="hero"><div><h2>Live Health Check</h2><p class="muted">Refreshes the existing SQL Agent health endpoint without changing SQL, OpenAI or authentication settings.</p></div><button type="button" id="refreshBtn" class="btn primary">Refresh</button></section><div class="infoGrid"><section class="card"><h3>HealthCheck.aspx</h3><pre id="healthOut" class="codebox">Loading...</pre></section><section class="card"><h3>Quick Checks</h3><div class="quickList"><a class="quickLink" href="Health.aspx" target="_blank"><strong>Open Full Health Page</strong><small>Existing detailed application health page.</small></a><a class="quickLink" href="Default.aspx"><strong>Open SQL Agent</strong><small>Verify the main AI workspace.</small></a><% if(SQL_AI_Agent.AuthService.IsAdmin){ %><a class="quickLink" href="Admin.aspx"><strong>Open Cost / Admin</strong><small>Verify Admin and configuration status.</small></a><% } %></div></section></div><div class="footer">Internal Use Only · Babco Labs Prototype</div></main></form><script>(function(){function run(){var out=document.getElementById('healthOut');out.textContent='Checking...';fetch('HealthCheck.aspx',{credentials:'same-origin',cache:'no-store'}).then(function(r){return r.text().then(function(t){return{code:r.status,text:t}})}).then(function(x){out.textContent='HTTP '+x.code+'\n\n'+(x.text||'(empty response)')}).catch(function(e){out.textContent='Health check failed: '+e.message})}document.getElementById('refreshBtn').onclick=run;run()})();</script></body></html>